All five phases explicitly assign PresShell, nsBlockFrame and nsGridContainerFrame from a complete role table, preventing previous-phase carryover. All other normalized sources are HEAD-identical throughout. There are no timing, tracing, float, proof, or104/105-removal phases. Existing101/104/105 stay equal in every build.

